WEBVTT

00:25:29.036 --> 00:25:30.596
And he’s only 12,

00:25:30.636 --> 00:25:32.356
and his friends don't like that.

00:25:32.396 --> 00:25:35.676
And so we talked about how do you help
your child feel supported

00:25:35.716 --> 00:25:39.356
in loving what he loves
and taking an improv class, right?

00:25:39.956 --> 00:25:43.156
So helping your kids learn
that it's OK to love something

00:25:43.196 --> 00:25:46.876
that's not the same
as all the other kids in their group

00:25:46.876 --> 00:25:48.596
and keep loving what they love.

00:25:48.596 --> 00:25:52.676
And helping kids learn
that it’s OK to be unhappy

00:25:52.676 --> 00:25:54.436
and that that will pass,

00:25:54.476 --> 00:25:56.396
that feelings come and go.

00:25:56.436 --> 00:25:58.996
That it’s OK to disagree.

00:25:59.596 --> 00:26:01.116
Families can model,